N2  - Laparoscopy is being used effectively for the staging, resecting, palliating, and preventing of gastrointestinal cancers. Continual improvement in surgical instrumentation and technical innovation will increase the applications of laparoscopic surgery in the diagnosis, staging, and treatment of gastrointestinal malignancies. Applications should continue to expand as novel techniques become routine.
